WEBVTT

00:01:59.196 --> 00:02:00.396
I don't know about you,

00:02:00.396 --> 00:02:03.996
but I'm starting to see
a small change in these scripts.

00:02:03.996 --> 00:02:05.156
These days,

00:02:05.196 --> 00:02:09.756
my social media feeds are full of posts
about women's sexual empowerment

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:14.236
and women's bodily autonomy
compared to, say, five years ago.

00:02:14.276 --> 00:02:15.916
And this is great.

00:02:17.076 --> 00:02:18.396
But in my work,

00:02:18.436 --> 00:02:23.396
I notice that this change
has not yet translated to real life

00:02:23.436 --> 00:02:25.156
and to the bedroom.

00:02:25.196 --> 00:02:27.916
Not that everyone has sex there,
but you know what I mean.

00:02:27.956 --> 00:02:29.076
(Laughter)